New Features: Added "completion" system for each run, a run auto-completes after 30 minutes as a "win";

Achievements: Added new hidden achievement; Fixed "Bro That's A Mile" achievement distance, from 2580 to the correct 5280; Adjusted interval achievement notifications, format value into message instead of onto the end;

QoL: Scaled up Integration command display for better visibility;
